@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "Server" as S
participant "Broadcast (All Clients)" as B

== EndRoundState Entry ==

S ->> B: onPhaseChanged(phase: PhaseType.END_ROUND)

note over S: Server notifies PhaseObservers\nBuildingEffects with END_ROUND effects activate

loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver)
    S ->> B: onPlayerResourceChanged(nickname: String, resource: String, newValue: int, delta: int)
end

note over S: EndRoundState.onEntryActions() triggered

== Branching Logic ==

alt Branch 1: Extra Turn Booked (extraTurnPlayerNickname != null)
    note over S: Set isExtraTurnMode = true\nUpdate currentPlayerNickname\nInitialize extra limits

    note right S: Transition to ActionResolutionState\n(Note: Building notifications are suppressed during Extra Turn)

else Branch 2: Round Events to Resolve (areRoundEventsToResolve == true)
    note over S: Transition to EventResolutionState
    note right S: See EventResolutionState diagram

else Branch 3: Default Case
    note over S: Transition to NewRoundState
    note right S: See NewRoundState diagram

end

@enduml